  "display_title": "Struck by an Obscene Curse",
  "description": "The inseparable three princesses of the Ernst Kingdom each had their own vice. Cecile was obsessed with her slender figure, and Charlotte was plagued by insomnia. But Abelle’s vice was comparatively tame: having the occasional lewd fantasy. That was until they were all cursed by a witch who sought vengeance on their father. Now, Cecile can’t stop eating, Charlotte can’t stop sleeping, and as for Abelle... Well, she can’t stop craving sex! As the only one capable of breaking the curse, the wanton princess must find a way to quench her desire or risk ruining her reputation!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
